# 22 -- a typed observable: PC_OBSERVABLE instead of PC_LAMMPS.
#
# Example 01 with the PC_LAMMPS line replaced by PC_OBSERVABLE: Tadah
# relaxes a 4x4x4 bcc Ta supercell in process (the relaxation limits of
# ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in) and differentiates the cohesive energy with
# respect to the hyperparameters analytically. No LAMMPS runs.
#
# GRAD_STRATEGY is not set: with PC_OBSERVABLE it resolves to ANALYTICAL
# for a gradient-based optimiser such as DLIB:BFGS (hpo_run.log says so).
# The analytical gradient needs OALGO 4 and a fixed LAMBDA; the local
# config.tadah sets them.

OPTIMIZER
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PLAIN
    LIB DLIB
    ALGO BFGS
    MAXEVAL 30
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_ERMSE 0 0.0001
PC_OBSERVABLE cohesive_energy --species Ta --target 8.10 --weight 800 --hotvar a0 2.5 4.5 3.302 --maxiter 500 --maxeval 500 --etol 1e-12

OPTIM RCUT2B (1) 4.0 6.0

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
